{"uid":"a897b057a3c8c67","name":"test_a_playground_runs_files_are_private_to_their_uploader","fullName":"tests.test_routes_run_scoping#test_a_playground_runs_files_are_private_to_their_uploader","historyId":"d001cb0752bfea90efd6e19a8ba1fdd3","time":{"start":1786403580593,"stop":1786403581770,"duration":1177},"description":"A playground run has no parent workflow, so it is scoped by uploader.\n\n    The list and download routes filtered on nothing but the caller-supplied\n    `playground_run_id`, so any authenticated caller who knew or guessed one could read\n    another user's files — an independent probe observed 200 on both. `project_id` cannot\n    carry this: playground uploads default it to `'default'`, so it isolates nobody.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>A playground run has no parent workflow, so it is scoped by uploader.</p>\n<pre><code>The list and download routes filtered on nothing but the caller-supplied\n`playground_run_id`, so any authenticated caller who knew or guessed one could read\nanother user's files — an independent probe observed 200 on both. `project_id` cannot\ncarry this: playground uploads default it to `'default'`, so it isolates nobody.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1786402727627,"stop":1786402727627,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1786402727649,"stop":1786402727649,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_dispose_create_app_engines","time":{"start":1786403580071,"stop":1786403580071,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps